# 默认全部忽略，只放行配置文本（白名单）
*
!*/
!.gitignore
!README.md
!AGENTS.md
!.githooks/*
!profiles/*/cordis.yml
!profiles/*/cordis.patch.yml
!profiles/*/package.json
!profiles/*/pnpm-lock.yaml
!profiles/*/pnpm-workspace.yaml

# 显式再挡一层：任何位置都不进仓库
.credentials.yaml
*.env
*.env.*
**/settings.json
*.bak
backups/
sessions/
storages/
logs/
cache/
attachments/
node_modules/
